%N A402039 Number of compositions of n containing all of their distinct multiplicities.
%F A402039 a(0) = 1. For n >= 1, a(n) = Sum_{S} Sum_{(m_j)} (Sum_{j in S} m_j)! / Product_{j in S} m_j!, where S ranges over nonempty subsets of {1,...,n} with Sum_{j in S} j <= n, and the inner sum is over m_j in S for each j in S satisfying Sum_{j in S} j*m_j = n.
%e A402039 For n = 10, the composition (4,2,1,1,1,1) has distinct multiplicities {1,4}, both of which occur among its parts. All 6!/4! = 30 rearrangements of these parts are counted among the a(10) = 274 compositions.
%Y A402039 Cf. A325705 (partitions).
%K A402039 nonn,new
